      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Mountains_(Arizona)",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ancient Indian and more recent ruins dot the park, with petroglyphs carved into desert varnish on the rocks.",
